    "detailed_description": "&quot;Sit on bottle&quot; - is a game about ordinary factory worker, whose job it is to sit on horizontally laid bottles. So, that would not lose - click with the left mouse button on the bottle until it is horizontal. The worker did not want to sit on a vertically placed bottle!<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n - Humor.<br />\r\n - Christmas decoration.<br />\r\n - The possibility of improving the interior and appearance of the player. <br />\r\n - Endless game mode, but with every second the Assembly line with the bottles is moving faster.<br />\r\n - Achievements.",
